Welcome to DhampirOS (Dhampir)!

DhampirOS is built on Kicksecure, which is built on Debian.
Kicksecure's security and hardening features are kept in place.

Security defaults come from Kicksecure. For details, see:
https://www.kicksecure.com/wiki/root
https://www.kicksecure.com/wiki/login

DhampirOS is an independent project. It is not made by Kicksecure.
